# Canonicalize to the apex (non-www) host: 301 www -> ollagraph.com.
# Consolidates SEO signals onto one host (matches every canonical tag, the
# sitemap, JSON-LD, IndexNow key, and the GSC sc-domain property). Path and
# query string are preserved via :splat.
https://www.ollagraph.com/* https://ollagraph.com/:splat 301
